/Alt (This figure shows the notifiable fraction of communicable disease notifications to the National Notifiable Disease Surveillance System. The number of notifications does not equal the number of cases, in general, the more serious the condition, the more likely it is to be notified and the larger the notifiable fraction. This figure demonstrates how notified cases only represent a small portion of the total incidence of disease.␀)
/K 528
/P 115 0 R
/Pg 49 0 R
/S /Figure
>>
